        "en": "Reviewers emphasize that dogs and cats receive affectionate, patient care from the veterinary staff and grooming team. Pet owners note that pets feel comfortable during physical exams, dental cleanings, and routine procedures. Multiple clients who have brought their companions for years commend the gentle touch and reassuring environment provided."
      }
